  m_Name: Carta_ParqueEolico
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Parque E\xF3lico"
  _titleEn: Wind Farm
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Turbinas e\xF3licas geram eletricidade com o vento, sem queimar combust\xEDvel."
  _summaryEn: Wind turbines generate electricity from the wind without burning fuel.
  _realWorld: "A energia e\xF3lica cresceu r\xE1pido no Brasil, com a maior parte
    dos parques no Nordeste, onde os ventos s\xE3o fortes e constantes."
  _realWorldEn: Wind power has grown fast in Brazil, with most wind farms in the
    Northeast, where winds are strong and steady.
  _tradeOffs: "O vento varia, ent\xE3o \xE9 preciso outra fonte de reserva; parques
    mal planejados afetam comunidades vizinhas e aves."
  _tradeOffsEn: Wind varies, so a backup source is needed; poorly planned farms affect
    nearby communities and birds.
  _sources:
  - Label: "Energia e\xF3lica no Brasil (Wikip\xE9dia)"
    Url: https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Energia_e%C3%B3lica_no_Brasil
